sangati navarasa

  "rati-abheda utsaha-abheda shoka-abheda krodha-abheda"
  "hasya-abheda bhaya-abheda jugupsa-abheda vismaya-abheda"
  "shama-abheda rasa-swarupa bhava-phala"
  "shanta-moksha-drishthanta purna-siddha"

  shabda rati, utsaha, shoka, krodha, hasya, bhaya, jugupsa, vismaya, shama, rasa, bhava, purna, moksha

done
